	<div class="twelvecol">
		<h2 class="title"><a href="https://silverscreenfolkestone.savoysystems.co.uk/SilverScreenFolkestone.dll/TSelectItems.waSelectItemsPrompt.TcsWebMenuItem_1047128.TcsWebTab_1047129.TcsProgramme_4385585">Ken Russell's The Devils</a> <img src="https://folkestonecinema.com/wp-content/themes/silverscreen-child/images/BBFC_18_RGB.png" alt="Certificate 18" height="25" style="height:25px;"></h2>
		<p><p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Ken Russell's shocking historical drama returns to cinemas, restored in 4K and fully uncut for the first time ever.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
